    "title": "Music Beat Night Show",
    "description": "Are you ready for the Rap Show? Welcome to Music Beat Night Show, a fun music rhythm game. Rap and dance, beat battle one by one. \r\n \r\n\ud83c\udfae HOW TO PLAY \ud83c\udfae\r\n- The opponent will sing a pattern of notes, you need to mirror by using the arrow keys.\r\n- Tap the arrow note as it reaches the scoring area, press and hold long arrows.\r\n- Follow rhythm and rap.\r\n- Challenge yourself with all difficulty modes: Easy, Normal, or Hard.\r\n- Get more coins and unlock all music!\r\n \r\nBeat battle and experience various rap music in this Music Beat Night Show right now!",
    "descriptionHTML": "Are you ready for the Rap Show? Welcome to Music Beat Night Show, a fun music rhythm game. Rap and dance, beat battle one by one. <br> <br>\ud83c\udfae HOW TO PLAY \ud83c\udfae<br>- The opponent will sing a pattern of notes, you need to mirror by using the arrow keys.<br>- Tap the arrow note as it reaches the scoring area, press and hold long arrows.<br>- Follow rhythm and rap.<br>- Challenge yourself with all difficulty modes: Easy, Normal, or Hard.<br>- Get more coins and unlock all music!<br> <br>Beat battle and experience various rap music in this Music Beat Night Show right now!",
